[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New & Improved[/B][/SIZE]

1. [B]Automated Pro Activation Pipeline & Multi-Identifier Resolution[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]The serverless Cloudflare activation backend ([ICODE]server/cloudflare-worker[/ICODE]) now indexes all associated PayPal identifiers across payment captures, orders, sales, and invoices ([ICODE]tx:${id}[/ICODE], [ICODE]tx:${orderId}[/ICODE], [ICODE]tx:${invoiceId}[/ICODE], [ICODE]tx:${captureId}[/ICODE]).
[*]PayPal No-Code Payment (NCP) contributions are resolved immediately regardless of whether you copy the Transaction ID or Order ID from your receipt, delivering instant in-app activation without waiting for manual key emails!

[/LIST]
2. [B]In-App PayPal Account Email Verification[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Added PayPal account email verification directly into the in-app Redeem Pro sheet ([B]Settings → Expressive Pro → Already contributed?[/B]).
[*]If your device ID was not bound during checkout, entering your PayPal account email automatically links your device and retrieves your offline cryptographic VIP/Pro key in seconds.

[/LIST]
3. [B]Official Business Support Email & Support Flow Overhaul[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Updated our official developer support & manual key issuance address across the entire app and privacy policies to [B][ICODE]denson9874@expressivelauncher.com[/ICODE][/B] (saying goodbye to personal Gmail for official app business!).
[*][B]Important[/B]: Automated in-app verification ("Check Activation Status" and "Verify via PayPal Transaction ID or Email") is the [B]primary, instant, 24/7 activation method[/B]. Manual email outreach is reserved as a fallback if automated checks cannot locate your receipt.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]💬 Support & Community Notice[/B][/SIZE]
[QUOTE]💡 [B]Reminder on Pro Activation[/B]: Before reaching out via email, always try tapping [B]Check Activation Status[/B] or entering your [B]PayPal Transaction ID / Email[/B] in the app first! It connects directly to our serverless engine to unlock your device instantly. If you still need a hand, our new business desk is ready at [B][ICODE]denson9874@expressivelauncher.com[/ICODE][/B].[/QUOTE]

